OL,3,AEx-prosecutor charged with treason in
OL,4,AMexico over US drug raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FFederal prosecutors in Mexico have
OL,7,Fcharged a former state prosecutor with
OL,8,Ftreason for allowing US agents to join
OL,9,Fa raid on a suspected drugs lab in
OL,10,FApril without proper authorisation.
OL,12,FCesar Jauregui Moreno served as
OL,13,Fattorney general of the northern border
OL,14,Fstate of Chihuahua from 2023 to this
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FThe involvement of Americans came to
OL,18,Flight after two US agents said to have
OL,19,Fworked for the CIA died in a car crash
OL,20,Fin Chihuahua along with two Mexican law
OL,21,Fenforcement officers.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
