OL,3,AEx-prosecutor charged with treason in
OL,4,AMexico over US drug raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FAttorney General Ernestina Godoy Ramos
OL,7,Fsaid Jauregui had allowed foreign
OL,8,Fagents to carry out activities reserved
OL,9,Ffor Mexican authorities and had failed
OL,10,Fto share information. Jauregui has
OL,11,Fdenied the allegations.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
